<title>POLAND: WOLCZANKA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANKA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.85 vs   0.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.36 vs   1.51</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.02 vs   1.14</p>
<p> Sales		    7.82 vs   8.82</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.65 vs   1.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.93 vs   3.25</p>
